 "quests": [
  {
   "copper": 96,
   "description": "A courier came back with half a dispatch and a very personal opinion of birds. Bring down five Ridge Crag Eagles by day in the Stormvault Eagle Crags, which lie in the south of Stormvault Heights, so our orders reach the front with the bearers attached. The Accord can argue over the wording once it arrives.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_passes_01",
   "min_level": 30,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 ridge_crag_eagle [in elandor_stormvault_heights/eagle_crags]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_stormvault_heights/eagle_crags",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:ridge_crag_eagle"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Postage and Talons",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "xp": 540
  },
  {
   "copper": 96,
   "description": "The eagles clock off at dusk, but don't put your weapon away. Rime Skeleton Strays climb out of the snow in the Stormvault Eagle Crags and loose arrows at our watch fires; break five of them at night. The mountain works two shifts, and neither of them sleeps.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_passes_02",
   "min_level": 31,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 5 rime_skeleton_stray [in elandor_stormvault_heights/eagle_crags]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_stormvault_heights/eagle_crags",
     "count": 5,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:rime_skeleton_stray"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_passes_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "The Mountain's Night Shift",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "xp": 555
  },
  {
   "copper": 64,
   "description": "Bring me four Silversteel Bars and I'll trade you a Silversteel Pickaxe. A dual furnace makes the bars from steel and silver; swearing at an ordinary furnace does not, though I've tested that thoroughly. You'll need it when you dig deep enough for Emberglass, where the rock turns too hard for steel.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_passes_03",
   "min_level": 31,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 4 grug_materials:silversteel_bar"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 4,
     "item": "grug_materials:silversteel_bar",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_passes_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [
    "grug_materials:pick_silversteel 1"
   ],
   "title": "A Proper Introduction to Rock",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "xp": 380
  },
  {
   "copper": 64,
   "description": "Every night, Rime Skeleton Strays insist on holding the Stormvault Passes, which lie in the southeast of Stormvault Heights. Break six after dark; I want wagons rattling through there, not ribcages. This bounty is repeatable, twenty minutes after you turn it in.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_bounty_strays",
   "min_level": 32,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 rime_skeleton_stray [in elandor_stormvault_heights/passes]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_stormvault_heights/passes",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:rime_skeleton_stray"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_passes_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Bounty: Bones Off the Road (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "xp": 370
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "Tell Toren Waterbarrel at Cinderline Watch in Ashenward March that the passes are open again. He keeps the Accord supplied, which means every clear road earns him another wagon to worry about. Lend him a hand, then ask after Glassroot Wilds; this front takes mountain, march and forest to hold it.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_road_ashenward",
   "min_level": 32,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Toren Waterbarrel (r20_anchor_031)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_031_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_passes_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Good News Travels on Foot",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_031_host",
   "xp": 190
  },
  {
   "copper": 32,
   "description": "Report to Alna Archsight at Archshadow Post when you're ready for harder ground. She keeps the sighting line trained on the front while goblins make off with our bolts. Mind your sums around her; she once found a missing crate by counting what the thieves dropped.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_027_host",
   "giver_name": "Borin Splitbolt",
   "giver_settlement": "Splitbolt Station",
   "id": "stormvault_road_archshadow",
   "min_level": 34,
   "objectives": [
    "talk to Alna Archsight (r20_anchor_028)"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "npc": "r20_anchor_028_host",
     "type": "talk"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_passes_02"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Alna Keeps Count",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 195
  },
  {
   "copper": 112,
   "description": "Our missing bolts are holding a goblin siege engine together, which is an insult to every smith who threaded them. Defeat six Siege Goblins or Siege Goblin Slingers at the Stormvault Goblin Camp west from here. Watch the slingers while you work; they have a distressing knack for finding the gap in a helmet.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
   "giver_settlement": "Archshadow Post",
   "id": "stormvault_sighting_01",
   "min_level": 34,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 6 siege_goblin or siege_goblin_slinger [in elandor_stormvault_heights/goblin_camp]"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "area": "elandor_stormvault_heights/goblin_camp",
     "count": 6,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:siege_goblin",
      "grug_mobs:siege_goblin_slinger"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Some Assembly Stolen",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 718
  },
  {
   "copper": 128,
   "description": "Bolt-Chewer guards the stolen hardware at the Stormvault Goblin Camp west from here, chewing through the stock between meals. Those bolts took a smith all morning; the beast doesn't even pause to admire the threads. Kill it before another crate ends up between its teeth.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
   "giver_settlement": "Archshadow Post",
   "id": "stormvault_sighting_02",
   "min_level": 35,
   "objectives": [
    "kill 1 bolt_chewer"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 1,
     "mobs": [
      "grug_mobs:bolt_chewer"
     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_sighting_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "No More Bolts for Bolt-Chewer",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 820
  },
  {
   "copper": 80,
   "description": "The sighting line needs new lenses; at present I can spot trouble, but not which trouble. Dig deep below the passes, where the rock turns too hard for a steel pick, and bring me two pieces of Emberglass; take a Silversteel Pickaxe for the job. We'll give the watch a clear view before anyone mistakes a siege engine for a supply cart.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
   "giver_settlement": "Archshadow Post",
   "id": "stormvault_sighting_04",
   "min_level": 36,
   "objectives": [
    "bring 2 grug_materials:emberglass"
   ],
   "objectives_raw": [
    {
     "count": 2,
     "item": "grug_materials:emberglass",
     "type": "item"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_sighting_01"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "A Clearer View of Trouble",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 525
  },
  {
   "copper": 112,
   "description": "The Entrenched Bandit Archers at Slatehook Hideout west from here rob the Accord and the Throng with admirable fairness. Defeat five of them before they strip another supply train. Use what cover you can; I want a report, not a demonstration of their aim.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
   "giver_settlement": "Archshadow Post",
   "id": "stormvault_sighting_03",
