   "title": "Bounty: An Overdue Dismissal (repeatable)",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 440
  },
  {
   "copper": 192,
   "description": "Stone Golem Split-Seam roams the Stormvault Stormcrags northwest from here, with a crack wide enough to tempt any dwarf with a hammer. Don't mistake that seam for an easy job; this golem can flatten a squad. Bring a group and destroy it, and leave the single-handed masonry to the workshop.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
   "giver_settlement": "Archshadow Post",
