     ],
     "type": "kill"
    }
   ],
   "prerequisites": [
    "stormvault_sighting_03"
   ],
   "reward_items": [],
   "title": "Group: A Crack Is Not a Weakness",
   "turnin": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "xp": 1320
  },
  {
   "copper": 400,
   "description": "I'd welcome a proper look at the old masonry, if Causeway Brigands and Aqueduct Bowmen would let our surveyors near it. Go by day to the Causeway Wraithwood, which lies in the east of The Broken Causeway, and defeat five of the brigands and bowmen lurking there. A dwarf should be able to criticise a crumbling arch in peace.",
   "giver": "r20_anchor_028_host",
   "giver_name": "Alna Archsight",
