  {
   "copper": 400,
   "description": "Our runesmiths reckon they can trace whoever put the Tollroad Skeletons back on their feet. Bring me three Siege Bones from those skeletons in the Causeway Toll Fields, which lie in the west of The Broken Causeway, after dark. I've given the smiths a bench of their own; their questions were spoiling everyone's supper.",
