   "description": "Senn's Aqueduct Bowmen are still at work in the Causeway Gallows Wood, which lies in the heart of The Broken Causeway, despite the change in management. Defeat five there by day for a bounty. I can pay for another five twenty-five minutes after each turn-in; I've a budget for clearing the road and every intention of spending it.",
