   "description": "Whoever built War Construct Last-Toll in the Causeway Toll Fields northeast from here did solid work and left miserable instructions. The elite war construct is still enforcing its toll. Gather a group and destroy it; we can admire the craftsmanship once it stops trying to flatten you.",
